					Od.
					24.250
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυγερόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.336
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ γήραος οὐδῷ</span> (v.
