				22.60
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. λιπαρόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.368
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
			</span></i> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. πολιόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					174
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆρας ἐκδῦναι,
