					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					329c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				2.73
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν γήρᾳ, ἐν γ. βαρύς</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1017
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διανοίας γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1271a1
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔστι γῆρας τοῦδε
				τοῦ μιάσματος</span>, i.e. it never wears out, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				682
			</span></i>. </div>
